%% Chroma Query Path Data Flow
%% Commit: 091f8bd5c553f8267c48664e98fb32215055f58e

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Client as ClientAPI
    participant API as ServerAPI
    participant Executor
    participant Planner as Query Planner
    participant VectorSeg as Vector Segment<br/>(HNSW)
    participant MetaSeg as Metadata Segment<br/>(SQLite)

    User->>Client: collection.query(query_texts, n_results, where, where_document)
    Note over User,Client: Synchronous query

    Client->>Client: Embed query_texts<br/>using embedding function
    Client->>API: _query(collection_id, query_embeddings, filters)

    API->>Executor: execute(collection, query)
    Executor->>Planner: create_plan(query_type, filters)

    Planner->>Planner: Analyze filters<br/>Optimize execution order
    Planner-->>Executor: KNNPlan + FilterPlan

    Note over Executor: Execute query plan

    Executor->>VectorSeg: query_vectors(embeddings, k)
    Note over VectorSeg: HNSW approximate<br/>nearest neighbor search
    VectorSeg->>VectorSeg: HNSW search (Rust)
    VectorSeg-->>Executor: candidate_ids + distances

    Executor->>MetaSeg: get_metadata(candidate_ids, where, where_document)
    Note over MetaSeg: SQL query with filters
    MetaSeg->>MetaSeg: SELECT WHERE ...<br/>(SQLite query)
    MetaSeg-->>Executor: filtered_records

    Executor->>Executor: Join vectors + metadata<br/>Apply where_document filter<br/>Sort by distance
    Executor->>Executor: Limit to n_results

    Executor-->>API: QueryResult(ids, embeddings, documents, metadatas, distances)
    API-->>Client: QueryResult
    Client-->>User: query() returns results

    Note over User,Client: Results ranked by similarity
